    { "type": "textarea", "id": "faq_a_9", "label": "A9", "default": "Usually it's where the room sits on the duct run. The rooms nearest the unit get the cold air first; every turn and branch takes some off, and the last room gets what's left. Put your hand on that vent with the AC running \u2014 if air is coming out but barely moving, that's this." },
